# Third-party conformance corpora, fetched at pinned upstream commits by
# scripts/fetch-csv-suites.sh (run by `npm test` via the pretest hook, and by
# go/conformance_test.go itself when a corpus is missing).
# Not vendored: they carry their own licences, and pinning by commit keeps
# the reported conformance numbers tied to a named upstream revision.
